            <div xml:id="d14">

                <pb facs="0091" n="9" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg9"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 835.3311/20.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Argentine Chargé
                            d’Affaires to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Argentine Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Washington, D.
                                C.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1911-03-18"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">March 18,
                    1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Secretary of State</hi>: In compliance with
                    instructions sent me by the minister of foreign relations, I have the
                    satisfaction of addressing your excellency to offer to you, in the name of my
                    Government, the expression of its sincere acknowledgment of the high honor
                    bestowed on my country by His Excellency President Taft, your excellency, and
                    other members of the Government in attending the luncheon offered on board our
                    school ship <hi rendition="#italic">Presidente Sarmiento</hi> on the occasion of
                    its stay at the navy yard in October last. Not only has that friendly
                    demonstration found a responsive echo in Argentina, but it is proof eloquent of
                    the cordial relations which both countries happily cultivate.</p>
                <p>Begging your excellency kindly to convey these sentiments to the President,</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Jacinto L.
                    Villegas.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
